    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BRANT & CO PROPERTY CONSULTANTS are delighted to present to the market this excellent three-bedroom, two bathroom mid-terrace house, ideally located at 36 Moylaragh Walk, Balbriggan.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented home offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The property has been fully painted and is presented in spotless condition, ready for its new occupants to move straight in.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious living room, and a well-appointed kitchen/dining area. Upstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from built-in wardrobes and an ensuite. The property also features two bathrooms, providing excellent convenience for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe bedrooms are well proportioned and benefit from built-in wardrobe storage, while the entire property has been maintained to a very high standard.\r\n\r\nLocated in the popular Moylaragh development, the property is within easy reach of Balbriggan town centre and benefits from excellent access to local schools, shops, public transport and a host of amenities. The M1 motorway is also easily accessible, making Dublin and surrounding areas readily accessible.\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a turn-key home in a popular residential location. Early viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the quality and presentation of this property."
      },
      {
